oximity To:**\n\n* Charni Road\n* Grant Road\n* Maheshwari Devi Temple\n* Mumbai Central\n* Marine Lines Railway station\n* Malbar Hill Police Station Bus Stop\n\n**Popular Landmarks in Malabar Hill**\n\n* Sardar Pav Bhaji\n* Haji Ali Juice Centre\n* Shalimar Restaurant\n* Sukh Sagar\n* Pizza By The Bay\n\n**Schools and Colleges in Malabar Hill**\n\n* Walsingham House School\n* ORCHIDS The International School - CBSE School in Masjid\n* Aditya Birla World Academy\n* Villa Theresa High School\n* Bhavans College\n\n**Hospitals in Malabar Hill**\n\n* Sir H. N. Reliance Foundation Hospital and Research Centre\n* Jaslok Hospital & Research Centre\n* Narayana Health SRCC Children's Hospital\n* Wockhardt Hospitals, Mumbai Central\n* Dr. Manish S Shah Clinic | Unit of Dr Agarwals Eye Hospital\n\n**Shopping and Entertainment in Malabar Hill**\n\n* CR2 Shopping Mall\n* City Centre Mumbai\n* Rubberwala The Platinum Mall\n* Bharat Bazar Mall\n\n## About Ruparel Realty\n\n![Ruparel Realty](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/developer/xYF7j8EXfIS8nvpaB32uc7m0M8vC74ZFEX323Zm5.png)\n\n* Year Estd. 2000\n* [Projects - 25](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/ruparel-realty-projects-in-mumbai)\n\n#### Ruparel Realty\n\nRuparel Infra And Realty Private Limited operates on the belief that they are not just constructing buildings, but are actively fulfilling the lifelong dreams of everyday\n\nread more\n\nMumbaikars. Managing millions of square feet of prime land across the Mumbai Metropolitan Region and Navi Mumbai, the firm partners with the finest architectural minds to craft iconic structures. Ruparel Realty approaches real estate with an energetic, people-first mindset, ensuring that each development elevates the lifestyle of its residents. They treat every square foot laid as a long-term promise of safety, prestige, and community well-being for the families who trust them.\n\nread less\n\n## QR Codes of R House Ruparel House\n\n![P51900052844.webp](https:/